Spec: Store

Purpose:
  Centralized application state using Zustand with slices pattern.

Structure:
  ./useStore.ts: Zustand store creation and subscription
  ./slices/shapes.ts: Shapes array, layers, material, selection state
  ./slices/ui.ts: Active tool, snap toggle, language, theme preferences

Owns:
  ./useStore.ts
  ./slices/**

Must:
  Use slices pattern for separation of concerns.
  Shapes slice holds shapes[], layers[], activeLayerId, material dimensions.
  UI slice holds tool (typed as ToolType), snap enabled, language, theme.
  setShapes() is the only way to update the shapes array.
  Store is not exposed on window in production (only DEV).
  Subscriptions trigger render only on canvas-relevant changes.

Must not:
  Expose store globally in production builds.
  Allow direct array mutation (always spread to new array).
  Store derived state (compute from shapes array when needed).

Depends on:
  zustand

Exposes:
  useStore (hook)
  useStore.getState()
  useStore.subscribe()
